direction: right
Learn: "LEARN\nPlain English + Manim"
Questions: "5 STRATEGIC QUESTIONS\nI need to ___ so that I can ___"
Whys: "CONNECTED WHY CHAIN\nNeed → Wish → Dream → Fantasy"
PERT: "PERT / STRESS\nAssess the Need Goal"
Tasks: "TASKS\nExecution"
Team: "TEAM DESIGN\nSupervisors + communication channels"
Labs: "ANALYSIS LABS\nMarket · Finance · Risk · Operations"
Evidence: "ASSUMPTIONS + LEARNING\nClay Tablets · Journal"
Plan: "FINAL PROJECT PLAN\nScope · schedule · team · tips · next steps"
Repeat: "REPEAT\nReassess after execution"
Learn -> Questions -> Whys -> PERT -> Tasks -> Team -> Labs -> Evidence -> Plan -> Repeat -> Learn
